This fix addresses a reported bug or regression in the game. Bug fixes in this project follow the TDD protocol: a failing test was written first to reproduce the issue, then the fix was applied to make the test pass, ensuring the defect cannot silently regress.

Key files: server/rooms/GameRoom.ts, src/core/CollisionSystem.ts, src/main.ts, src/network-main.ts, src/test/mobius-collision-fallback.test.ts, and others.

Bugs in this game are often surface-specific or code-path-specific. A fix that works in single-player may not apply to multiplayer because SP uses GameLoop.ts while MP uses network-main.ts. The project tracks false-positive verified claims in .claude/state/false-positives.md. Bug fixes require a minimum of Level 5 verification (Puppeteer screenshot) before being declared complete, as unit tests alone cannot prove gameplay issues are resolved.
